      "writtenOn": "2023-12-28T22:58:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The repro step is to make haiku: `SANITIZE_TARGET\u003dhwaddress SANITIZE_HOST\u003daddress make haiku` and examine the zip files under out/soong. In terms of packaging: build/soong/fuzz/fuzz_common.go. The next step is to test running the fuzzer on clusterfuzz locally, but I can do that once we verify the packaging part.",
      "parentUuid": "05379642_a0bf040b",
