      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which exact files are you looking at? When I reproduce and look at `out/soong/.intermediates/fuzz/target/x86_64/libsrtp2-fuzzer.zip` I see the following:\n\n```\nArchive:  libsrtp2-fuzzer.zip\n  inflating: libsrtp2-fuzzer_seed_corpus.zip  \n extracting: config.json             \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libc++.so    \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libclang_rt.ubsan_standalone-x86_64-android.so  \n  inflating: libsrtp2-fuzzer\n```\n\nand for Wi-Fi:\n\n```\nArchive:  ./keystoreGetWifiHidl_fuzzer.zip\n  inflating: config.json             \n  inflating: lib/vendor/android.system.wifi.keystore@1.0.so  \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libhidlbase.so  \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libutils.so  \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libc++.so    \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libclang_rt.ubsan_standalone-x86_64-android.so  \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libbase.so   \n  inflating: lib/vendor/libcutils.so  \n  inflating: keystoreGetWifiHidl_fuzzer\n```\n\nAre you looking at ./soong/.intermediates/fuzz/host/x86_64/libsrtp2-fuzzer.zip instead?",
